<title>UK: Svenska Handlesbanken sets $200 mln one-year FRN. [CORRECTED 13:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Svenska Handlesbanken sets $200 mln one-year FRN. [CORRECTED 13:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDLESBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    31.JUL.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    -6.25 BP   PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  5 BP	ISS PRICE  100.034   REOFFER     100.034</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>(Corrects Moody's rating from A3).</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
